      "source_feature": "F100-mcp-server-full",
      "category": "review",
      "content": "純格式違規（gofmt struct tag 對齊）這類零風險阻擋項，Coder 在送 review 前應先跑 gofmt -l 對 feature diff 檔自檢，避免浪費一整輪 review/amend 循環。",
